<title>CANADA: TrizecHahn declares semi-annual dividend.</title>
<headline>TrizecHahn declares semi-annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>TrizecHahn Corp on Wednesday said its board of directors declared a semi-annual dividend of US$0.12 per share on the company's issued and outstanding subordinate voting shares and multiple voting shares.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable March 17, 1997 to shareholders of record at the close of business on March 3, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
